<title>UK: Ghana cocoa purchases 902 t in 23rd week of 1996/7.</title>
<headline>Ghana cocoa purchases 902 t in 23rd week of 1996/7.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana cocoa purchases were 902 tonnes in the 23rd week of the 1996-7 season, ending March 20, with the cumulative reaching 298,479 tonnes, the Ghana Cocoa Board said on Friday.</p>
<p>The figures compare with 1,961 tonnes last year in the week ending March 21, when the cumulative stood at 341,584 tonnes.</p>
<p>The board said last week it would accept final returns on purchases until April 17.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 8072</p>
